00:37:40,520 --> 00:37:46,420
Meet Peter Lind, the man behind such flavors as wavy gravy and chocolate chip cookie dough.

634
00:37:47,800 --> 00:37:57,100
It's more working from what your taste buds are telling you, what works together well, what textures connect.

